## 3. DIRECT REFERRAL COMMISSION (5% INSTANT)

* On every member you directly sponsor with your referral link, you receive a flat 5% instant Direct Referral Bonus of their package amount.
* Example: If your direct member activates with $2,000, you instantly receive $100 in your wallet.
* There is no limit on the number of direct referrals you can make.
* Having at least 1 active direct referral also unlocks the 5X Capping Booster.

## 4. 20-LEVEL ROI-TO-ROI GENERATION MATCHING INCOME

* Members earn a daily percentage based on the daily ROI earned by their team across 20 generation levels.
* Level 1: 15% of the daily ROI earned by direct members.
* Level 2: 10% of the daily ROI earned by level 2 team members.
* Level 3 to Level 5: 5% of the daily ROI earned by team members in levels 3, 4, and 5.
* Level 6 to Level 10: 3% of the daily ROI earned by team members in levels 6 through 10.
* Level 11 to Level 20: 2% of the daily ROI earned by team members in levels 11 through 20.
* This matching bonus is credited every single day as long as team members receive their daily ROI.

